---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About — Teach4Texas">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-[#1B365D] mb-8">About Teach4Texas</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <p>We're Texas educators building the resources we wish we'd had.</p>
      <p>Teach4Texas was created by a team that includes TIA-designated teachers who've been through the process firsthand. We know what it takes to boost student performance on STAAR, document growth effectively, and earn TIA designation — because we've done it.</p>
      <h2 class="text-[#1B365D]">Our Mission</h2>
      <p>Texas has over 370,000 teachers. The Teacher Incentive Allotment has awarded $481 million to 42,000+ teachers across 665 districts — but most teachers still don't know how to take advantage of it. We're here to change that.</p>
      <p>We connect the dots that nobody else does: <strong>effective STAAR prep drives student growth, and student growth drives TIA designation.</strong> Our resources are built around that connection.</p>
      <h2 class="text-[#1B365D]">What We Offer</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>STAAR prep resources</strong> updated for the redesigned format</li>
        <li><strong>TIA guides</strong> written by designated teachers</li>
        <li><strong>Templates and tools</strong> that save you time on the busywork</li>
        <li><strong>Practical strategies</strong> — no theory, no fluff, just what works</li>
      </ul>
      <h2 class="text-[#1B365D]">Get in Touch</h2>
      <p>Have questions or want to share your TIA story? Email us at <a href="mailto:hello@teach4texas.com" class="text-[#BF5700]">hello@teach4texas.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
